  "origin": "Selected works from 78 Danish authors from the Middle Ages to the mid-20th century, reproduced from standard printed editions and digitised by the Royal Danish Library (Det Kongelige Bibliotek) as the Archive for Danish Literature (ADL). 498 samples, 58.49M Llama-3 tokens. The dataset was originally distributed as part of the Danish Gigaword corpus and carried forward into dynaword.",
